@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title DearFuture — entidades do domínio
class User <<Entity>> {
  - id : UUID
  - name : String
  - email : String
  - passwordHash : String
  - createdAt : Instant
  # User()
  + User(id: UUID, name: String, email: String, passwordHash: String, createdAt: Instant)
  + changeDisplayName(name: String) : void
  + getId() : UUID
  + getName() : String
  + getEmail() : String
  + getPasswordHash() : String
  + getCreatedAt() : Instant
}
class Capsule <<Entity>> {
  - id : UUID
  - owner : User
  - title : String
  - message : String
  - createdAt : Instant
  - opensAt : Instant
  # Capsule()
  + Capsule(id: UUID, owner: User, title: String, message: String, createdAt: Instant, opensAt: Instant)
  + getId() : UUID
  + getTitle() : String
  + getMessage() : String
  + getCreatedAt() : Instant
  + getOpensAt() : Instant
}
Capsule "0..*" --> "1" User : owner
note on link
  @ManyToOne(fetch = LAZY, optional = false)
  @JoinColumn(owner_id, nullable = false)
  Sem remoção em cascata
end note
note bottom of User
  changeDisplayName valida antes de alterar.
  Nome: 1..120 caracteres após trim.
  E-mail normalizado e único no banco.
end note
note bottom of Capsule
  Imutável após criação.
  opensAt > createdAt.
  Título: 1..120; carta: 1..10000.
  Disponibilidade calculada: agora >= opensAt.
end note
@enduml
